sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.shift-swaps.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee ShiftSwapController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Export (PDF/Excel/CSV)
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/shift-swaps/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: listForWorker(worker_id) + filter tanggal/rekan
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests + relasi terkait
    DB-->>Model: Dataset export
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap diekspor

    alt Data valid (format valid dan data tersedia)
        Controller->>View: Return file pdf/xlsx/csv
        View-->>Pegawai: File tukar shift berhasil diunduh
    else Data tidak valid (worker tidak ditemukan / filter error / format invalid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal ekspor tukar shift
    end
